WEBVTT

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:14.950
<i>In the year 2020 C.E.,</i>

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.370
<i>the human world is connected by a network.</i>

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:24.080
<i>Inhabiting it is
an unknown life form called Digimon.</i>

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:48.230
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:48.230
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:54.320
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:54.320
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:11.090
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:11.090
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:21.310
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:21.310
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:26.480
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:26.480
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.900
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.900
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:37.700
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:37.700
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:42.580
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:42.580
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:47.790
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:47.790
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:52.670
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:52.670
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:58.470
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:58.470
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:04.310
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:04.310
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:10.730
<i>Taichi Yagami is a boy
who is enjoying his summer break.</i>

00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:15.570
<i>He finds out that his family had been
caught in the cyberterrorism in Tokyo.</i>

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:18.990
<i>Called by a mysterious voice,</i>

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:22.660
<i>Taichi is swallowed
into the world of the Network.</i>

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:29.250
<i>He encounters a mysterious life form
called Digimon and...</i>

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:38.880
<i>Looks like the American military's
tactical data network is being targeted!</i>

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:41.390
<i>A weapon will go out of control next.</i>

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:43.260
<i>If that happens,</i>

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:46.060
<i>it'll be the end of the world!</i>

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:52.440
Hey, wait!

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:07.700
Fox Fire!

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:22.220
You owe me one.

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:25.220
Heh, so you were alive.

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:31.310
That's a human, right?

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.730
Let's go, Garurumon.

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:36.980
But...

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:41.320
We have to go.

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.620
Taichi.

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:53.500
Let's go too.

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:57.000
WAR GAME

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:04.130
That Digimon's fast!

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:05.010
Yeah!

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:06.010
Huh?

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:11.390
Greymon!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.640
Mega Flame!

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:23.400
I paid you back!

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.280
Isn't Greymon awesome?

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:31.540
You guys are trying to stop
those wild Digimon too, right?

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.210
Let's do it together!

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:35.040
I'm Taichi Yagami.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:38.670
I've got another friend.
I'll introduce you!

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:42.550
Koshiro, you watching?

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.470
I made a friend!

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:46.300
Yes!

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.550
Um, nice to meet you...

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:51.310
<i>My name's Koshiro Izumi.</i>

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:53.350
Where is this guy?

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.270
Around Musashi-Kosugi Station.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:57.860
<i>Oh, you never heard of it?</i>

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.520
<i>Where you from?</i>

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:03.190
<i>Taichi-san, please save that for later!</i>

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:05.740
I'm starting to see
the military's tactics!

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:07.320
<i>Seriously?!</i>

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:13.290
<i>Looks like the attacks have allowed
control of all command systems.</i>

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:18.330
<i>It's unconfirmed, but their defense
programs seem to have no effect either.</i>

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.880
This isn't looking good.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.500
How do you know this?

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:27.340
Koshiro's awesome! He looks up everything!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:31.890
I'm also connected to people
who are web experts.

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:36.100
Those people tell me everything.

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:40.230
Isn't that called classified information?

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:44.230
That's why Koshiro's so awesome!

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:50.030
Hey, don't you think we'll be stronger
if we form a team?

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:54.500
<i>It's Izumi, right?</i>

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:56.250
Uh, yes.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.750
This is Garurumon.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:01.630
I'm Yamato Ishida.

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:04.250
I look forward to your support.

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.590
<i>Of course, Yamato-san!</i>

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:08.510
All right!

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:11.300
Let's work together as a team--

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:12.300
Go.

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:14.260
Oh! H-Hey!

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:17.430
I said let's go together!

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.480
Geez...

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:20.690
<i>Hey, Izumi.</i>

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:21.770
Huh?

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:24.900
<i>What's happening
with that military system now?</i>

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.780
Y-Yes.

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:30.030
It looks like they're trying
to regain control,

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:32.950
but it seems like there's no progress yet.

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:36.620
So you have this too, Yamato-san.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:37.750
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:40.290
He can just call me Koshiro...

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:43.920
Where did he come from?

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:49.260
It feels like he knows more
about this world than us...

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:56.810
<i>I see some alarming information
on my timeline!</i>

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:00.940
<i>They said to watch out
for a nuclear submarine!</i>

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:02.980
Submarine?!

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.440
HQ, emergency!

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:10.610
Our ship is falling
into an uncontrollable state!

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:14.070
It is now out of our hands
and rapidly surfacing!

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:14.950
Captain!

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.450
The missile launch control is activating!

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.040
<i>What?!</i>

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.960
I've gotten information that there's been

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:25.630
a command on a nuclear submarine
in the Atlantic to attack!

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:29.840
<i>It's preparing for a missile launch!</i>

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.130
Say what?!

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.720
<i>Koshiro, when is it gonna launch?!</i>

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:35.140
<i>Where is it targeting?!</i>

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:38.390
I only have bits and pieces
of information right now...

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:39.390
<i>Izumi.</i>

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:42.900
Where's the area
that's controlling that missile?

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:46.820
<i>The Digimon causing this should be there.</i>

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:50.110
If I analyze
all the information up to now,

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:54.280
I may be able to find a route
into the military's system!

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.740
No, I will find it!

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:59.790
Please give me some time!

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:03.580
We're counting on you, Koshiro!

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:24.310
I found a route in!

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:26.650
Way to go, Koshiro!

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:27.820
Huh?

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:30.820
<i>This is the route in
from both of your locations!</i>

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:35.240
<i>With this, you can get there
in the shortest amount of time.</i>

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:39.990
<i>There isn't much time left!
I wish you two luck!</i>

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:41.370
Leave it to us!

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:43.830
Let's go, Greymon!

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:45.790
Yeah!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.780
You okay, Taichi?

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.160
Yeah...

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.240
Huh?

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:23.750
<i>Taichi-san!</i>

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:26.540
<i>That's the missile's network!</i>

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:29.500
<i>Please get rid of
the Digimon causing this!</i>

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:33.010
<i>There's two minutes and ten seconds
until the missile is launched!</i>

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:40.640
Here they come!

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:55.860
If there's this many, we'll never make it!

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:01.240
Isn't that... the boss?

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:04.240
It's the biggest one!

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:15.510
Attack!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:17.880
Yamato!

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:19.510
Stay there!

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.270
Yamato...

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:32.940
Why?

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:40.530
Taichi!

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:43.450
Right now, that big one's...

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:45.950
wide open!

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:50.790
I see now, Yamato and Garurumon...

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.090
That's what they were aiming for!

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:05.100
Go.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:16.980
Only one minute and fifty seconds left!

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.570
Go!

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:31.080
Mega... Flame!

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:36.710
Fox... Fire!

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.560
We did it!

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:02.320
I got what you were thinking.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:05.450
But you could've said something first!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:06.450
Huh?

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:08.700
It's not over.

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:02.880
It evolved again!

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:04.800
How many times...

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:08.510
is it gonna evolve?!

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:14.810
Hey, Yamato!

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:19.190
Let's go, Greymon!

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:20.270
Yeah!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:32.660
Greymon!

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.180
Yamato!

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:00.860
<i>Taichi-san! Yamato-san!</i>

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:08.450
Garurumon!

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:09.990
Greymon!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:20.210
Hey, Yamato.

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:23.210
You can't win by fighting alone.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:26.050
If we work together again, we can win!

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:28.430
We couldn't finish it earlier.

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:33.350
You two, there's no time left!

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:36.480
<i>We need to find a way somehow!</i>

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:48.360
Greymon!

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:57.000
Yamato, you know of a way, right?

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:58.910
If there is, let's do it!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.630
It's too dangerous.

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:07.300
This method is a double-edged sword.

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:11.510
If we fail, who knows what'll happen
to Garurumon and Greymon...

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:17.220
I'll take it.

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:18.890
Greymon...

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:23.150
Besides, there's no other way, right?

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:27.400
We can handle it.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.700
You're right.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:35.830
There's nothing we can't do
if we put our heads together!

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:37.830
Don't worry.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:41.580
I'm going to believe in Greymon.

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:44.420
So are you, right?

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.100
I'm counting on you, Greymon!

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:58.270
Leave it to me!

00:15:58.390 --> 00:15:59.310
Garurumon!

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:00.180
Yeah!

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:12.820
Fire away, Greymon!

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:21.830
Now, Garurumon!

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:39.100
Ultra close-range attacks!

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:40.850
Garurumon!

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:44.100
Greymon!

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:48.110
Fire!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:23.770
Huh?

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:34.400
<i>It's not over!</i>

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:37.360
<i>It's not over yet!</i>

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:09.730
The missile...

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:12.940
has been launched.

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:40.590
What's happening...?

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:42.300
We have to end this!

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:43.810
Greymon!

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:46.350
Mega Flame!

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:49.690
Fox Fire!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.960
It isn't working?!

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.420
<i>Taichi-san.</i>

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:15.250
I've identified the missile's target...

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:17.170
<i>Oh, where is it?!</i>

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:18.880
It's...

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:21.510
Tokyo!

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:22.390
<i>What?</i>

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:29.980
<i>If... this missile hits...</i>

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:32.560
<i>Tokyo will...</i>

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:36.150
<i>Tokyo will be annihilated!</i>

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:25.280
If we don't stop this,

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:27.700
Tokyo will be annihilated.

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:29.660
Darn...

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.710
I'll stop it no matter what!

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:35.710
No one else...

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:39.710
but us can stop this.

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:42.720
We are...

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.220
Gonna stop this!

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:52.480
Taichi-san!

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:07.120
Taichi-san...

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:18.460
What's... this?

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:07.430
<i>As if rolling out of control,
I ran frantically</i>

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:07.430
<i>korogaru youni gamushara ni hashitta</i>

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:11.310
<i>"What's waiting ahead?"</i>

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:11.310
<i>nani ga matteru no?</i>

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:17.810
<i>The headwinds told me</i>

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:17.810
<i>mukaikaze ga oshiete kuretanda</i>

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:21.690
<i>"Just believe and move forward"</i>

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:21.690
<i>shinjite susume</i>

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:24.530
<i>The bitter taste of defeat is a seed</i>

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:24.530
<i>yaburete shitta kuyashisa wa tane</i>

00:22:24.650 --> 00:22:27.150
<i>It will eventually sprout
And become your wings</i>

00:22:24.650 --> 00:22:27.150
<i>yagate mebuki hane to naru</i>

00:22:27.280 --> 00:22:30.990
<i>I knock on those doors</i>

00:22:27.280 --> 00:22:30.990
<i>sono tobira tataku riyuu</i>

00:22:31.120 --> 00:22:36.830
<i>Because the present shapes the future</i>

00:22:31.120 --> 00:22:36.830
<i>ima ga mirai wo tsukuru kara</i>

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:39.120
<i>If you want to find a rainbow</i>

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:39.120
<i>niji wo mitsuketai nara</i>

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:42.290
<i>You must lift your face</i>

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:42.290
<i>kao wo agenakuchatte</i>

00:22:42.420 --> 00:22:47.550
<i>The hands that reached out to us
Make us much stronger</i>

00:22:42.420 --> 00:22:47.550
<i>sashidasareta te ga
bokura wo zutto tsuyoku suru</i>

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:49.640
<i>If you want to catch your dreams</i>

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:49.640
<i>yume wo tsukamitai nara</i>

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:52.930
<i>Though the step forward is unsteady</i>

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:52.930
<i>furueru sono ippo mae ni</i>

00:22:53.060 --> 00:22:55.680
<i>Try and take it</i>

00:22:53.060 --> 00:22:55.680
<i>fumi dashite goran yo</i>

00:22:55.810 --> 00:23:00.690
<i>Because you can surely fly now</i>

00:22:55.810 --> 00:23:00.690
<i>ima nara kitto sora mo toberu kara</i>

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:03.980
<i>A missile closes in on Tokyo!</i>

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:08.740
<i>Can the new Digimon work a miracle
before the powerful enemy?</i>

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:12.620
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"And to the Digital World"</i>

00:23:12.740 --> 00:23:15.410
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
